  {
   "title": "Magsipag-: plural of mag- verbs",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "**Magsipag-** makes the plural of **mag- verbs**. It changes the same way as magsi-: **nagsipag-** for the past, and the present and future repeat **si**."
    },
    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "rule",
     "title": "Hyphen before a vowel",
     "t": "Put a **hyphen** after magsipag- when the root starts with a vowel, as with [[aral|pred]] (*study*) and [[akyat|pred]] (*climb*): **magsipag-áral**, **magsipag-akyát**. This is the same as mag-áral in Lesson 14."
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "head": [
      "Form",
      "Verb",
      "How",
      "Meaning"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "Root",
       "[[lakad|pred]]",
       "",
       "walk"
      ],
      [
       "Infinitive",
       "[[magsipaglakád|pred]]",
       "magsipag- + root",
       "to walk"
      ],
      [
       "Imperative",
       "[[magsipaglakád|pred]]",
       "magsipag- + root",
       "walk"
      ],
      [
       "Past",
       "[[nagsipaglakád|pred]]",
       "magsipag- becomes nagsipag- + root",
       "walked"
      ],
      [
       "Present",
       "[[nagsísipaglakád|pred]]",
