  {
   "title": "Pag- + -in: plural of -in verbs",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "t": "The passive forms put the focus on the **receiver** of the action (Lessons 15 and 33). **Pag- + -in** (or its variant **pag- + -hin**) makes the plural of a passive **-in verb**."
    },
    {
     "type": "table",
     "head": [
